@startuml
title 46.4 - Reemplazo atómico de restricción (ejemplo: zona restringida)

autonumber
hide footbox

actor "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API PROPUESTA\nPUT /planning/restrictions/{restrictionId}" as API
control "Lógica de aplicación propuesta\nNO IMPLEMENTADA" as App
database "PostgreSQL\n(db_script.sql)" as DB

note over Frontend, DB
Contrato propuesto. PUT reemplaza el agregado completo.
No existe backend implementado en este repositorio.
La búsqueda por ID es genérica; restrictionType es inmutable.
end note

Frontend -> API: PUT /planning/restrictions/901\n{cabecera completa, schedules, vehicleRules}
API -> App: validar path, JSON, campos requeridos y tipos básicos

alt Path o JSON mal formado
  App --> API: BAD_REQUEST
  API --> Frontend: 400\n{success: false, code: 400, error}
else Request estructuralmente válido
  App -> DB: BEGIN
  App -> DB: SELECT * FROM planning_restrictions\nWHERE id = :restrictionId AND deleted_at IS NULL\nFOR UPDATE\n(sin filtro por restriction_type)
  DB --> App: cabecera o vacío

  alt Cabecera no encontrada
    App -> DB: ROLLBACK
    App --> API: RESTRICTION_NOT_FOUND
    API --> Frontend: 404\n{success: false, code: 404, error}
  else Cabecera encontrada
    App -> App: comparar request.restrictionType\ncon cabecera.restriction_type

    alt restrictionType cambió
      App -> DB: ROLLBACK
      App --> API: RESTRICTION_TYPE_IMMUTABLE
      API --> Frontend: 409\n{success: false, code: 409,\n error: {type: RESTRICTION_TYPE_IMMUTABLE}}
    else restrictionType coincide
      App -> App: validar catálogo, geometría del tipo persistido,\nEMPTY_SCHEDULE y reglas vehiculares

      alt Semántica no válida
        App -> DB: ROLLBACK
        App --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR
        API --> Frontend: 422\n{success: false, code: 422, error}
      else Semántica válida
        App -> DB: SELECT id FROM distributors\nWHERE id = :distributorId FOR SHARE
        DB --> App: distribuidora o vacío

        alt Distribuidora no encontrada
          App -> DB: ROLLBACK
          App --> API: DISTRIBUTOR_NOT_FOUND
          API --> Frontend: 404\n{success: false, code: 404, error}
        else Distribuidora existente
          App -> DB: SELECT id, planning_restriction_id, deleted_at\nFROM planning_restriction_schedules\nWHERE id = ANY(:scheduleIds) FOR UPDATE
          App -> DB: SELECT id, planning_restriction_id, deleted_at\nFROM planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\nWHERE id = ANY(:vehicleRuleIds) FOR UPDATE
          DB --> App: pertenencia y estado de IDs

          alt Un ID no pertenece al agregado o ya está eliminado
            App -> DB: ROLLBACK
            App --> API: CHILD_RESOURCE_CONFLICT
            API --> Frontend: 409\n{success: false, code: 409,\n error: {type: CHILD_RESOURCE_CONFLICT}}
          else Todos los IDs son válidos
            App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restrictions\nSET campos mutables y auditoría\nWHERE id = :restrictionId

            loop Schedules con ID
              App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_schedules\nSET campos y auditoría WHERE id = :id
            end
            App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_schedules\nSET deleted_at = now(), auditoría\nWHERE planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nAND NOT (id = ANY(:receivedScheduleIds))
            loop Schedules sin ID
              App -> DB: INSERT INTO planning_restriction_schedules\n(..., planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId)
            end

            loop VehicleRules con ID
              App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\nSET campos y auditoría WHERE id = :id
            end
            App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\nSET deleted_at = now(), auditoría\nWHERE planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nAND NOT (id = ANY(:receivedVehicleRuleIds))
            loop VehicleRules sin ID
              App -> DB: INSERT INTO planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\n(..., planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId)
            end

            alt Falla cualquier escritura
              DB --> App: error de persistencia
              App -> DB: ROLLBACK
              App --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR
              API --> Frontend: 500\n{success: false, code: 500, error: {type: INTERNAL_ERROR}}
            else Todas las escrituras son exitosas
              App -> DB: SELECT agregado actualizado\ncon hijos deleted_at IS NULL
              alt Falla la relectura canónica
                DB --> App: error o agregado incompleto
                App -> DB: ROLLBACK
                App --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR
                API --> Frontend: 500\n{success: false, code: 500, error: {type: INTERNAL_ERROR}}
              else Relectura canónica exitosa
                DB --> App: recurso canónico completo
                App -> DB: COMMIT
                App --> API: recurso actualizado
                API --> Frontend: 200\n{success: true, code: 200, data}
              end
            end
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
end

note over App, DB
Hijo con ID: actualizar.
Hijo sin ID: insertar.
Hijo activo omitido del arreglo: eliminar lógicamente.
No hay restauración implícita.
La relectura canónica ocurre antes del COMMIT.
end note

@enduml
